      "writtenOn": "2021-02-02T17:47:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the main change here is around EC_RESET_FLAG_POWER_ON but it is a bit hard to spot. Maybe this could be rearranged to make it clearer?\n\nEC_RESET_FLAG_POWER_ON being set for an EC reset doesn\u0027t seem right: would fixing that avoid the need for this change?",
